Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Source: OCR of hardcoded English subs ([1053-1054] End of Wano 02 - New Emperors.mp4); opening lyrics omitted}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.46,0:01:30.04,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Edited by fedew\NSubtitles by HatSubs
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.26,0:01:36.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is this picture?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.09,0:01:37.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of all the ridiculous...!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.51,0:01:39.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought we told him\Nto remove the damned "D.", too!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.89,0:01:41.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, sir, we weren't told about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.89,0:01:45.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We received the photos\Nfrom Guernica-sama of CP-0.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.64,0:01:47.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You will reprint them,\Nimmediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.69,0:01:50.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hear me? Such drivel will not be\Nunleashed unto the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.11,0:01:53.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But sir, we're unable to\Ncontact the printing company...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.24,0:01:57.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Useless, the whole lot of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.32,0:02:00.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We must stop distribution, somehow!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.20,0:02:08.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's this?\NThis mystical figure...!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.00,0:02:09.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Deliver! Deliver!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.92,0:02:12.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Deliver every single copy,\Nemployees of mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.21,0:02:17.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cipher Pol infiltrated Wano,\Nand no one's heard from them since!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.76,0:02:21.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Their final transmission:\N"It's Big Mom's ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.80,0:02:25.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not letting 'em cover this up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.85,0:02:29.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The times are a changin',\Nand that's when the truth's the most interesting!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.94,0:02:32.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's nothing like good old\Nlive entertainment!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.78,0:02:41.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,W-What the?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.70,0:02:43.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a special edition!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.16,0:02:44.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,An incident?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.03,0:02:46.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, check this out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.20,0:02:50.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Emperors of the Sea,\NKaido and Big Mom, Defeated"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.00,0:02:55.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In seemingly no time at all,\Nthe massive headline circled the globe,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.09,0:03:00.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As for the trio of pirate captains\Nwho felled the two Emperors...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.38,0:03:02.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...that lorded over the seas for decades...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.68,0:03:08.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Government placed an exorbitant bounty\Nof three billion berries on each of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.64,0:03:13.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Three billion berries?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.90,0:03:14.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.94,0:03:16.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wow, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.77,0:03:19.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!\NLemme get a closer look!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.49,0:03:21.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Read here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.03,0:03:23.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No freakin' way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.20,0:03:24.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.58,0:03:27.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa, Boss?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.33,0:03:31.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where's Kid off to now?\NAnd with that weird look on his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.33,0:03:33.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Probably to the Flower Capital
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.25,0:03:39.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We got a new Emperor of the Sea, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.38,0:03:42.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No wonder they picked them...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.09,0:03:45.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys! Heard they're havin'\Na feast in the capital today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.72,0:03:47.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's join 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.35,0:03:48.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aye!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.72,0:03:50.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just in time!\NWe gotta celebrate!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.35,0:03:53.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's get crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.35,0:03:56.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yay! Festival, festival!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.90,0:03:57.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're pumped!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.90,0:04:04.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And there goes trouble, again...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.91,0:04:07.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Add cloud ear mushrooms\Nand chrysanthemum petals to the soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.53,0:04:12.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A plate of gisei tofu.\NA bowl of flower-shaped lotus roots.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.08,0:04:13.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A small bowl of pickled vegetables...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.29,0:04:17.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We must not let anything happen\Nto our valued guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.38,0:04:21.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So we grind everything once,\Nheat it up, and reshape it,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.17,0:04:22.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,then test it for poison three times...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.42,0:04:27.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And now, my skills\Nare on full display today!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.47,0:04:32.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please partake of our traditional cuisine,\Nworthy of the Shogun himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.89,0:04:35.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, what is this?\NB-But why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.61,0:04:41.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,None of them could wait the two hours\Nfor the dishes to be ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.61,0:04:46.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Still, it all looks so delicious!\NI appreciate your consideration!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.32,0:04:51.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's quite lively out there,\Nwouldn't you say!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.04,0:04:53.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Festival, festival!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.04,0:04:55.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's play 'til we drop!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.08,0:04:56.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.33,0:04:59.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's chocolate bananas\Nand yakisoba!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.21,0:05:01.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Takoyaki and grilled squid!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.80,0:05:03.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cotton candy, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.09,0:05:10.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This's the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.01,0:05:11.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everything's on the house today!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.97,0:05:13.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,On the house!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.18,0:05:17.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is my first time at a festival!\NSuch fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.15,0:05:21.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's so much tasty stuff,\NI can't decide what I wanna eat next!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.98,0:05:24.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Say, you two!\NWhat are those?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.61,0:05:26.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're called candy apples!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.57,0:05:28.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Tis practically a jewel!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.91,0:05:30.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.12,0:05:38.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sweet and sour!\NWonderful flavors!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.54,0:05:41.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Any other fruit\Nwouldn't taste this good!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.63,0:05:44.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What're we waitin' for?!\NLet's dig in!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.80,0:05:50.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sho good!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.39,0:05:54.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Say, since you two know so much,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.89,0:05:57.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,tell me of any\Nnon-food stalls as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.73,0:05:59.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Awwright, leave it t'me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.60,0:06:03.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When you're full,\Nyou just gotta go...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.61,0:06:08.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum Target Shooting!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.24,0:06:11.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah!\NGot 'im good!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.37,0:06:14.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You are a funny one, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.24,0:06:16.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy, you're not supposed\Nto use your hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.33,0:06:18.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can I go again, old guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.21,0:06:19.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nuhhh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.04,0:06:24.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It broke...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.63,0:06:25.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How about another try!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.88,0:06:28.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, it's my turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.97,0:06:37.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're in!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.31,0:06:39.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, that was amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.02,0:06:41.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're pretty good, Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.77,0:06:46.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You ain't gonna make me happy\Nby complimenting me, ya jerks!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.69,0:06:48.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But he looks really happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.03,0:06:53.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!\NYou all having a great time, folks!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.49,0:06:55.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.33,0:06:59.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, all right!\NRock on, Brook!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.00,0:07:04.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This number is a big hit,\Nand it's going to light up Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.17,0:07:08.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna deliver to you the finest soul music,\Ntogether with the princess you all love!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.13,0:07:12.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right! It's the song\Nthat Brother Oden loved!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.85,0:07:15.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Moon Princess"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.47,0:07:19.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Princess Hiyori!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.74,0:07:35.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What might these be?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.83,0:07:38.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Piqued your interest, Nico Robin?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.87,0:07:41.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tengu-san!\NHow do you know my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.41,0:07:43.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My personal collection.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.21,0:07:43.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.75,0:07:46.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Comely, are they not?\NMy beautiful girl kokeshi dolls!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.79,0:07:47.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not particularly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.67,0:07:49.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oof!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.55,0:07:52.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My, how melodramatic!\NYou're so silly, Tengu-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.38,0:07:57.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it,\Nwhy keep your collection here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.05,0:08:02.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is my secret hobby room,\Nand the place in which I was confined for many years.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.64,0:08:03.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Confined"?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.27,0:08:09.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I suppose you're more than\Njust a swordsmith, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.07,0:08:11.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Smithing is but\Na mere hobby of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.28,0:08:13.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Though it seems I've the aptitude for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.49,0:08:21.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Governing tires me so...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.33,0:08:24.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who are you, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.01,0:08:38.01,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(438,632)}Former Shogun of Wano\NKozuki Sukiyaki
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.71,0:08:34.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My name is Kozuki Sukiyaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.68,0:08:37.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Father to Kozuki Oden.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.55,0:08:39.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.26,0:08:40.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Does Momo-chan know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.72,0:08:43.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He does not.\NNor do I intend to tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.31,0:08:44.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.85,0:08:48.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...our retainers may have noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.77,0:08:54.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am the principal culprit in allowing\NOrochi to usurp our country's throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.20,0:08:57.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As such, who would I be able\Nto tell that I yet live?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.49,0:09:01.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When I barely escaped\Nthis room with my life,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.87,0:09:06.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden was already dead,\Nand the Land of Wano had changed for the worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.79,0:09:10.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I considered\Nritual disembowelment where I stood,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.96,0:09:13.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but had no choice but to hide...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.17,0:09:17.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...until the coming day\Nfor the sake of my remaining mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.14,0:09:24.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And now, after what transpired since,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.48,0:09:28.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I owe my deepest gratitude\Nto all of you for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.52,0:09:33.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they'll all be happy to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.19,0:09:35.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that so...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.28,0:09:39.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, Tengu-san.\NThere's something I'd like to talk to you about...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.95,0:09:43.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I believe this country possesses one of them...\NThe Ancient Weapon,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.12,0:09:44.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pluton.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.29,0:09:51.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How do you know this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.63,0:09:56.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's written on the Poneglyph\Nin the Kingdom of Alabasta.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.26,0:10:01.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And here I did not expect\Nanyone to know so much...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.14,0:10:04.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aye, 'tis here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.60,0:10:11.61,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1549,471)}Former\NExcavation\NLabor Camp
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.60,0:10:11.61,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1549,139)}Udon
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.32,0:10:20.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Noooo, I'm the\Ndon't-wanna-be-thin kind of guy...!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.99,0:10:23.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I warned ya not to test me, didn't I?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.03,0:10:27.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A guy in my position can't go around\Ngetting beat by some pirate's underlings!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.71,0:10:31.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Navy don't got the manpower\Nto clean up this mess right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.79,0:10:34.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Still, turned out\Nlike I thought it would...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.09,0:10:36.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess you guys did okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.77,0:10:48.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ain't the best swill, for sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.14,0:10:50.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sheesh...\NShoulda aged it longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.23,0:10:54.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ring, ring, ring...\NClik.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.65,0:10:55.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir, this is-
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.82,0:10:59.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's me.\NSend a battleship to Wano, on the double!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.40,0:11:01.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! Oh, G-Green Bull-
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.41,0:11:04.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And no tattlin'\Nto Sakazuki-san! Out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.24,0:11:05.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Clik.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.45,0:11:09.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I like that about him, really do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.67,0:11:13.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,His "cut no corners" attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.84,0:11:20.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wanna earn his praise,\Nlike a "Good job" or something...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.38,0:11:22.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,By taking this brat's head, maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.89,0:11:29.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who's that up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.10,0:11:34.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Kay, listen up, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.31,0:11:37.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ninjas, pirates, Minks, and samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.61,0:11:38.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The king's retainers!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.90,0:11:41.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yakuza, and all of Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.61,0:11:45.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Way to put up a hell of a fight,\Nye scalawags!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.16,0:11:46.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good going, young man!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.41,0:11:48.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Make a toast!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.08,0:11:50.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do it, feastmaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.00,0:11:51.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Awwright, you got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.33,0:11:54.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.17,0:11:59.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't tell the\Nwhole country about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.13,0:12:00.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why would I not?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.42,0:12:02.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It'd make me a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.43,0:12:07.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And what is the matter with that?\NThere is no denying your victory over Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.05,0:12:08.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ya big idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.35,0:12:10.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone's been waitin'\Nfor you, Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.14,0:12:14.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.52,0:12:16.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.06,0:12:19.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If I get rid of you here...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.23,0:12:20.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jaggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.15,0:12:22.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's set them off!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.70,0:12:26.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right! To tomorrow's food...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.41,0:12:31.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The hell're ya doin'?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.00,0:12:35.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.46,0:12:37.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.59,0:12:44.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Make some noise!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.43,0:12:45.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.68,0:12:55.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll absolutely keep drinking to that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.10,0:12:56.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's party!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.94,0:13:01.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Got that, y'all?\NWe're gonna drink the night away!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.36,0:13:05.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're a wild bunch,\Nthose pirates...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.82,0:13:10.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Honestly, who's ever heard of such\Nan enormous feast as this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.13,0:13:23.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't get me involved!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.51,0:13:25.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on! It's a party!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.80,0:13:28.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I ain't got a clue about\Nwhat's happening overseas...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.43,0:13:31.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But d'ya see this crap?!\NThis's why I'm here to get rid of ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.31,0:13:41.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hwuuuuh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.94,0:13:45.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Indeed, Eustass Kid went to Luffy,\Nan expression of anger on his face,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.82,0:13:48.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,for a very clear reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.45,0:13:51.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It is the herald of\Nthe end of the old regime,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.74,0:13:55.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and the beginning of a new era.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.79,0:13:59.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Buggy, the Genius Jester...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.42,0:14:02.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Blackbeard" Teach...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.67,0:14:05.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Red-Haired Shanks...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.34,0:14:11.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And Straw Hat Luffy...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.60,0:14:16.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,These are the new emperors...\NThe Four Emperors of the Sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.90,0:14:30.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The festival music\Nsounds awfully happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.16,0:14:35.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But the Navy ain't\Nin the mood for that, brats...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.45,0:14:38.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Partytime's over...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.96,0:14:43.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna bleed all of you dry...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.34,0:14:53.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The outside world's a mess...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.76,0:14:57.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna take your head,\Nso just wait for me there...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.90,0:15:10.40,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1683,491)}The\Nwaters\Nnear\NWano
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.22,0:15:32.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Been a while...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.60,0:15:39.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is my first time back here\Nsince we said goodbye to Oden-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.02,0:15:46.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momo and Hiyori must be\Nall grown up by now...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.58,0:15:58.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's something here...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.79,0:16:03.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...that shouldn't be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.09,0:16:12.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ms. Ninja Lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.06,0:16:28.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Something foul approaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.57,0:16:29.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It comes from outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.90,0:16:31.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shinobu!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.36,0:16:33.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You both felt it as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.57,0:16:36.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Something approaches!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.12,0:16:37.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take heed, all...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.49,0:16:42.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy-dono and his comrades\Nare still recovering from their battle wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.79,0:16:44.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do not let them know about this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.25,0:16:52.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So you-gara noticed, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.92,0:16:55.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We must not allow\Nthe din of the festival to stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.72,0:16:56.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onward!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.11,0:17:10.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They say "influence" is something...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.94,0:17:13.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...that's hard to come by...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.99,0:17:18.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...when you really want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.00,0:17:28.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.08,0:17:31.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Only guy I've got business with\Nis Straw Hat Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.55,0:17:37.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't get in my way, samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.68,0:17:41.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,H-He is... a marine of the Navy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.06,0:17:43.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The enemy Luffy-dono\Nand his crew faced abroad!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.48,0:17:48.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You bunch actually know\Nabout the outside world, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.23,0:17:53.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then... d'ya know about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.82,0:17:57.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Flower Shuriken!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.04,0:18:08.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shinobu!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.29,0:18:09.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Raizo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.00,0:18:09.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aye!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.00,0:18:14.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kappa Style:
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.43,0:18:22.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,River of Retribution!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.18,0:18:27.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sheesh...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.24,0:18:36.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.94,0:18:38.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Determined, aren't ya...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.24,0:18:40.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...ya damn samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.16,0:18:47.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Raizo-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.17,0:18:53.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Celestial Dragons\Nare the gods of the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.09,0:18:57.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And since this country isn't\Na member of the World Government,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.21,0:19:00.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you ain't got no rights!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.72,0:19:03.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am sorry...!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.06,0:19:08.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Groves of Wrath!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.50,0:19:35.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I ate the Woods-Woods Fruit\Nand became a Woodsman!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.09,0:19:43.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just like the seas,\Nthe woods bear forth life!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.18,0:19:46.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's the very essence of Logia!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.97,0:19:51.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you're gonna be in my way,\NI'll just deal with the bunch of ya permanently!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.98,0:19:56.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It don't matter how many people I kill in this country\N'cause the law don't reach here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.03,0:20:03.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You spurn us?!\NHow can you think so little of our people?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.11,0:20:07.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here's a lesson for ya:\NHumanity's always kept some of its own down!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.41,0:20:14.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's 'cause the sacrifice of a few's\Nnecessary to make peace for the many!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.75,0:20:20.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Non-member countries like yours\Nare sacrificed for the sake of the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.46,0:20:25.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And by keepin' folks like you down,\Nthe rest of us can go on with our lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.18,0:20:27.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Discrimination is comfort!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.06,0:20:34.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't hate me, though!\NThat's just the way the world works!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.07,0:20:44.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop me if ya can!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.41,0:20:54.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even if it means\Nkillin' thousands of people,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.58,0:20:58.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get my hands\Non Straw Hat Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.46,0:21:01.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Every last word of yours...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.13,0:21:03.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...is inexcusable!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.94,0:21:25.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ey, boss!\NLet's go see Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.99,0:21:28.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's pretty much\Na great pirate now!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.87,0:21:34.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whattaguy, for real
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.55,0:21:45.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yow, ow, owch!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.26,0:21:47.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's some strong Haki!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.13,0:21:49.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For twenty years,\Nthey endured tyranny...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.51,0:21:55.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And only now were they fully liberated,\Nso I will not allow any interruption of their celebration!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.52,0:21:57.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who the hell're you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.23,0:22:00.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am Yamato, son of Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.69,0:22:03.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido's...?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.07,0:22:04.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right you are, Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.24,0:22:07.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.24,0:22:13.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You will not lay your hand\Nupon our recovering heroes!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.91,0:22:15.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A dragon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.21,0:22:20.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Blast Breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.59,0:22:32.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.05,0:22:34.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Regardless...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.10,0:22:39.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Begone!\NLeave the sight of the capital!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.23,0:22:41.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do not cause my people anguish!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.23,0:22:44.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I promised my people\Nthere would be no more!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.52,0:22:47.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Strange...\NA pink dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.03,0:22:49.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've never heard of\Nsuch a Devil Fruit power!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.70,0:22:50.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're in my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.00,0:23:01.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.83,0:23:04.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.13,0:23:07.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You must not fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.63,0:23:08.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.39,0:23:22.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're gonna be inside\NWano's borders soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.31,0:23:23.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,H-Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.94,0:23:26.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold off on going ashore...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.36,0:23:29.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.44,0:23:32.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...not really ready to see Usopp...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.66,0:23:36.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah... And I bet that\Nbrat Kid's still there, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.08,0:23:39.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He came tryin' to pick a fight\Nwith us just the other day!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.41,0:23:41.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, pipe down!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.29,0:23:44.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Boss'll decide what we're doin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.09,0:23:52.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.28,0:24:10.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.11,0:24:11.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Red-Haired's ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.45,0:24:17.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They've got CP9 agents aboard!\NPain in my ass...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.83,0:24:22.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who cares?\NWe're going!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.71,0:24:28.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fire! Keep Red-Haired away!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.64,0:24:38.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn him!\NWhat's he doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.39,0:24:40.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What does he want?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.93,0:24:43.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no treasure on this ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.56,0:24:45.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's just one Devil Fruit...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.15,0:24:48.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's the big deal about it?!\NAll it does is turn you into rubber!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.96,0:25:09.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I ain't just horsin' around!\NI'mma prove it to ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.71,0:25:14.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh, go on then!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.76,0:25:21.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Owwieee!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.64,0:25:22.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You dunce!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.56,0:25:24.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell're you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.77,0:25:26.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.40,0:25:33.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,His arm stretched!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.11,0:25:36.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The heck's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.01,0:25:56.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Scram.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.05,0:26:04.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't cry!\NI thought you were a man!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.48,0:26:07.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But... Shanks...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.73,0:26:11.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.36,0:26:20.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guess all our bosses know\NStraw Hat Luffy personally...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.91,0:26:23.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They say Straw Hat Luffy's...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.41,0:26:29.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I heard he's outta control,\Na totally savage monster of an ape...!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.75,0:26:31.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Got no intention of seeing Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.33,0:26:33.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.04,0:26:36.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Think about what's going on\Nin our territories these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.63,0:26:39.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That man going on about\Nbeing Luffy's henchman, Barto...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.63,0:26:41.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Barto... Whatshisface?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.14,0:26:44.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He burned our Jolly Roger\Nand changed it to Luffy's...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.47,0:26:47.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's the future Pirate King,\NLuffy-senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.10,0:26:49.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is his crew's sticker!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.64,0:26:52.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This island's the territory of\NShanks of the Four Emperors!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.86,0:26:53.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Say whuh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.53,0:27:01.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One o' the Four Emperors?!\NI dun give a crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.87,0:27:05.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we just let it slide...\NI'd lose people's trust in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.79,0:27:08.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, that's true...\NBut still...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.71,0:27:11.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aw, C'mon, Boss!\NI wanna see him!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.13,0:27:14.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Ah, what's the harm?\NSuppose a little look wouldn't hurt...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.67,0:27:15.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wanna see him!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.30,0:27:16.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.13,0:27:17.63,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(987,156)}Alabasta Kingdom\NRevolutionary Army Chief of Staff\NSABO MURDERS COBRA
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.59,0:27:21.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't allow the Revolutionary Army\Nto run around unchecked, Red Hound!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.47,0:27:26.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know that already,\Nbut I don't got the troops to deploy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.22,0:27:28.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sabo...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.27,0:27:31.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's a hero to the world now!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.14,0:27:32.15,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1541,803)}Naval Bureau of Investigation
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.85,0:27:37.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eight hundred years ago,\Nthe World Government was created by twenty founders.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.61,0:27:43.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of their descendants, only Nefertari Cobra\Nattended the Reverie this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.66,0:27:47.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's why his murder had\Nsignificance to the Revolutionary Army!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.50,0:27:54.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A few hours before that, in the Land of the Gods\Nwhere the Celestial Dragons live,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.00,0:28:00.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,they destroyed the Hoof of the Celestial Dragon,\Nthe symbol of the World Nobles, and declared war!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.22,0:28:05.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Led by Admirals Green Bull and Wisteria Tiger,\Nthe Navy fought back, but the outcome...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.51,0:28:09.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Former Revolutionary Army soldier and\NCelestial Dragon slave...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.47,0:28:13.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Bartholomew Kuma was freed,\Nand they all escaped!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.36,0:28:21.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It must've been difficult for the Admirals\Nto fight in the Land of the Gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.70,0:28:24.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't need to\Nmake excuses for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.49,0:28:32.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And what of Princess Vivi's disappearance?\NThis occurred around the same time as Cobra's murder...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.46,0:28:36.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Both cases currently under investigation,\Nalong with any connection between them.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.88,0:28:39.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alabasta's got to be\Na complete mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.46,0:28:43.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,King Cobra's ship\Nis still at the Red Port...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.63,0:28:46.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The situation dictates\Nthey can't leave for home.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.39,0:28:51.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can we close the case\Non the attempted murder of Saint Charlos?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.77,0:28:55.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In regard to Saint Myosgard\Nexcusing the assailants,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.90,0:28:58.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,they're still deliberating\Nin the Land of the Gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.61,0:29:02.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Holy Knights intervened,\Nand it's getting complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.49,0:29:07.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Leave them to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.91,0:29:14.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,People are excited, thinking that\NSabo was behind all these incidents!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.25,0:29:19.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The lands that were a part of the recent\N"Eight-Nation Revolution,"
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.25,0:29:23.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and anywhere around the world\Nwhere there's sparks of rebellion,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.59,0:29:28.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,have started worshipping him like a god!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.39,0:29:33.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're calling him\Nthe "Flame Emperor"!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.64,0:29:35.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,His popularity now exceeds...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.31,0:29:41.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...that of "Insurgent Serpent" Dragon,\Nleader of the Revolutionary Army!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.77,0:29:38.27,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,75)}"Revolution"
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.48,0:29:48.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And to top it all off, his younger brother,\NStraw Hat Luffy, is now one of the Four Emperors.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.78,0:29:52.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In the pirate world,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.58,0:29:56.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the Flame Emperor's brother\Ndid away with the old guard!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.04,0:29:58.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, a new era is upon us!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.09,0:30:07.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For cryin' out loud...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.34,0:30:12.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hell of a time I picked\Nto become the Fleet Admiral...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.68,0:30:15.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But no matter how they come at me,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.27,0:30:20.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna send hell right back at 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.80,0:30:53.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Beck...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.06,0:30:58.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Think it's about time\Nwe take it for ourselves...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.19,0:31:07.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The One Piece!
